Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:48.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在树林深处 谁看得到?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the middle ofthe woods. Who's gonna notice?{\r}
