Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:52.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 算了吧.{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.10,0:03:58.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特里呢?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,where's Trey?{\r}
