Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:14.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:18.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人啦 救命 救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please,help! Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 快来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.31,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚开 光头佬?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you step off,skinhead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:03.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对抗一个人 就是对抗整个团队?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fight one bean,you fight the whole burrito,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:05.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quita!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.23,0:08:09.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你安排好了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got your shit set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:13.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要别让你的人搞砸就行了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just make sure your fucking tacojockeys don't fuck it up.{\r}
