Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:51.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱就是钱 钱能使世界运转{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money is money. It makes the world go round.{\r}
