Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.77,0:10:15.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 回头见 - 再见{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll see you out there,man. - See ya.{\r}
