Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:25.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 认识这位威利吧? - 是啊 三区的犯人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know Willy here,don't you? - A prisoner from Cell Block 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:30.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威利·华雷斯 其实是个警官 这是Marshal Davis 警官{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}WillyJuarez is actually U.S. Marshal WilliamJuarez. This is Marshal Davis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:33.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们帮助我们转移到黑泽尔顿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna help us out with the Hazelton transfer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:36.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是Carlo 查韦斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}specifically with Carlo Chavez.{\r}
