Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:41.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我提前到今晚了 我听到些消息…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,well,I pushed it to tonight. Our friends here got word...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:44.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查韦斯的团伙想在转移途中救他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Chavez's gang may attempt to break him out during the transfer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:48.18,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们让Juarez卧底来调查谁为他传的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We putJuarez undercover to try and find out who he's passing the information through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到车上把查韦斯跟他锁在一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You chain him up next to Chavez on the bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:53.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈特 我的真实身份只告诉了你以防意外{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nate,onlyyou will know my real identity in case ofan incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:57.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个计划要成功 就要让查韦斯相信我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,for this to work,Chavez has to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保险起见 我改变了路线{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As an added precaution,I've altered your route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:02.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我们 没人知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody knows it but the people in this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:05.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠你了 奈特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm counting on you,Nate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:22.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 艾力 - 不客气 老大{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks,Ally. - No problem,boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警务站 我是副手Lane{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff's station. Deputy Lane speaking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:33.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥时候?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.48,0:11:36.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们开的什么样的车?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What type ofvehicle were they driving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们到哪接你们?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ye-Yeah. Where can we reach you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:43.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 我们会联系你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks. We'll get back to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:47.83,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几个大学生失踪了 去河里划橡皮艇 再也没回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some college kids went missing. They were river rafting and didn't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 多久了? - 有几天了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long? - A couple ofdays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪里? - 蓝鱼河附近{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - Bluefish River area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是在那野营 想多嗨皮几天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They probably stayed over so they could camp a little longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:57.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我开车去看看 - 我去就行了 警长 你不用亲自去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll take a drive out there. - I can do that,Sheriff. You don't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.21,0:11:59.46,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:01.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想呼吸下新鲜空气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use the fresh air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:04.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走 利昂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,Leon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:08.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,come on! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:23.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们他妈的想干什么? - 我们坐车出去兜兜风 查韦斯先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the fuck do you want? - We're going on a bus ride,Mr. Chavez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:27.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在? - 是的 你知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What,now? - Yeah,now. You know the drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:34.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这次转移不对 你们要带我去哪? - 黑泽尔顿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well,this shit ain't right. Where are you taking me? - Hazelton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:37.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们告诉我是下周转移{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they said I wasn't going till next week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜有人迫不及待想爆你菊花了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess they couldn't wait to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我东西咋办? - 我们会打包运走的 走吧 查韦斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about my shit? - We'll have it boxed up and shipped. Let's move,Chavez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:48.14,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再碰老子一下 就扭断你的手指{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Touch me again,I'll break your fuckin' fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:50.97,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧 别逼我冒火{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just move your ass before I lose my patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:05.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不 别把我和这个杀人犯锁在一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,no,you don't. No. You're not chaining that murderer next to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 克劳福德.{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up,Crawford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:11.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让查韦斯走前面 Juarez随后 其他人跟上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get Chavez up front followed by Juarez here and then the rest of'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:13.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么意见?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意见是 我不想和一个疯子锁在一起…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My problem is I don't wanna be chained to a whackjob...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:18.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把战后的创伤都发泄在一个酒吧服务员身上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who went all post-traumatic stress on some poor asshole in a bar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.71,0:13:22.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打 打… 打过仗又能怎么样呢 兵哥哥?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,what-what-what... You know,couldn't hack the war,soldier boy? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.76,0:13:26.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 喝点酒就控制不住了? - 我就推了他一下 他就摔倒了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't handle your liquor? - Listen. I pushed the guy. He fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:29.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰好撞到头部? 我是无辜的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he hit his head. Okay? I'm innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:32.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 我也是 - 你们都是无辜的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. So am I. - And so is everyone else in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.72,0:13:35.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不要相信囚犯 恩?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never trust a con,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:39.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不信你的狗屁话 当兵的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not buying your bullshit,soldier boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:41.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你抢劫取款机的时候被抓到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you had your hands all up in the cash register.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:46.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 少来烦我 - 哦 兵哥哥希望不去烦他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just leave me alone. - Oh,now. Soldier boy wants to be left alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:49.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 她咋啦? 是不是你老婆背着你劈腿了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! She had what? You get a "DearJohn" letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:52.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是当你发现…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah,went psycho...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:55.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老婆和海军陆战队员嘿咻的时候 精神崩溃了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you found out yourwife was fucking a real marine,you punk-ass bitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:59.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 够了 闭嘴 - 我只是不想和杀人犯锁在一起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's enough. Shut up. - Man,I'm just saying,I don't wanna be chained to a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我至少是个偷车的 这是正当职业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,at least stealing cars,that's an honorable trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:06.51,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天 克劳福德 弗洛伊德 啥了三个我们知道的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ,Crawford. Floyd over here killed three people that we know about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:10.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不一样 弗洛伊德是我的朋友 - 快走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That-That's different,man. Floyd's my friend.  - Just get moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:23.65,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开 注意你的步子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out ofthe way. Move. Watch your step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是中转站 在这里加油{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here are the transfers. Gas up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:32.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你们预定到达时间之前20分钟会通知警长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sheriffwill be told you're coming 20 minutes before you're scheduled to arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:55.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草泥马的 让我们通宵赶路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid shit,making us go all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:58.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马勒戈壁的 你说呢?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking bullshit! Don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:00.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 别他妈说话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fuck up and don't talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,佛洛依德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floyd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:04.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 干什么? - 你笑个J8?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell?  - What you laughing at,bitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:06.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 去死吧 Adolf - 你死定了 墨西哥人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fuck you,Adolf. - You're dead,wetback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:08.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:11.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你关心的不应该是他?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not him you should be worrying about. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:14.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心 我把话传出去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. I got the word out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:18.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好别出什么差错 朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It better be all right,homes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:23.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你念完法律之后干什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you gonna do when you graduate law school?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.83,0:15:25.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做律师{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Practice law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道 聪明人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that,wiseass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:31.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哪种律师? - 能让我在曼哈顿东区…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What kind of law? - The kind that buys me a big townhouse...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:33.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,买一处大房子的律师{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the Upper East Side of Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:37.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那么 你是为了钱? - 我计划做些免费服务{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So it's all about money? - I plan on doing some pro bono work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要先取得成功{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first I got to be successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.97,0:15:42.19,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很有追求嘛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. You got some pretty big expectations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.27,0:15:44.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我上完学 念完法律{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put myselfthrough school,and I'm gonna put myself through law school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.02,0:15:48.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作到退休 然后去迈阿密{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I'm all done,I wanna retire to,like,Miami.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南沙滩 享受生活{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South Beach. Live a nice,comfortable life,you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:54.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退休?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:58.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候你都老的享受不鸟了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,you'll be too old to enjoy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:02.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱不是万能的 兄弟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money isn't everything,my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我得吁吁 - 受不鸟了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I gotta go. - Just can't wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:36.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 走 - 老天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move. - Oh,God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.99,0:16:40.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 瓦尔特 急什么? - 我要小便{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Walter,where's the fire? - Man,I got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:42.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我也是 你能不能快点?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey,me too,man. Can you hurry it up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:45.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们挨个挨个去厕所{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will each have an opportunity to use the restroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.21,0:16:52.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 继续走 - 嘿 美女{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep moving. - Hey,sweetie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:55.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是奈特? 奈特 威尔逊?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nate? Nate Wilson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 真没想到 - 你好啊 警长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well,I'll be damned. - Hi,Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次看到你的时候你才12岁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't seen you since you were about 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.76,0:17:01.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面你们搬家了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,since your folks moved away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:04.31,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是利昂吗? 过来 伙计{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Leon? Here,boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.39,0:17:08.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 14岁了 还是很笨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure is. Fourteen years old and still acts like a knucklehead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:10.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你爸怎么样了? - 几年前去世了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How's your dad? - Uh,Dad passed away a few years back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:12.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈还很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom's fine though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.53,0:17:14.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉 - 下一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry to hear that. - Next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:17.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好人 以前在磨坊遇到麻烦…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a good man. He was a great help when we had that trouble...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:19.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他帮了我们很大的忙 - 嗯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- at the old mill years ago. - Mm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕就是那时留下的病根{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it got to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:24.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真没想到你都这么大了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe howyou've grown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:26.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且成了法律工作者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Law enforcement to boot. Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们认识? - 是啊 奈特就在这里长大的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You two know each other? - Sure thing. Nate was brought up around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:32.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈特 我就知道你是乡下人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn,Nate. I knewyou were a hick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.30,0:17:35.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 但不知道你在这么鸟不生蛋的地方长大 - 就是这{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But,like,shit,this is the middle of nowhere. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 来点咖啡? - 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coffee? - That'd be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:37.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:46.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好是在盯着我的胸牌看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That better be my name tag you're staring at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:48.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝 他们是常规配置吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those guns standard issue,baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻点 美女{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy there,honeypot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:54.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢粗鲁点的?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,you like the rough stuff,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:58.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使把我全身绑起来 我也能满足你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell,I can do that. Even all tied up,I can show a girl a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:02.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你喜欢被绑起来吗? - 你是说五花大绑…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You like being tied up? - You mean all hog-tied,bound and gagged...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.28,0:18:05.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 动也不能动? - 就是这样 宝贝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- to where I can't move a muscle? - Aw,yeah. That's it,baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.04,0:18:09.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不喜欢被绑起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I don't like to be tied up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:11.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 甜心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw,now,don't be that way,sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.25,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 进去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You,get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:20.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:26.27,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么要经过"绿蔷薇"?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you going through Greenbrier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.35,0:18:30.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要犯人 路线要保密{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High-profile prisoner. They wanted to keep the route confidential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.23,0:18:33.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要走老磨房的路? - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You going by the old mill road? - Yeah. That's the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:37.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到山那边就走高速公路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until we hook up with the main highway on the other side ofthe mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:02.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 很高兴见到你 奈特 一路平安 - 谢谢 警长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's good to see you,Nate. Safe trip. - Thanks,Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:05.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们穿过山区之后给我个电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey. Give us a call when you get through the backcountry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:08.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或给我你的手机号 我给你打{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or give me your cell,and I'll call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:11.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你回来的时候我们可以喝一杯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can grab a beer on your way back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:13.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:51.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是个阴谋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a conspiracy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:55.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我意思是 世界银行掌握在12个混蛋手中…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,the World Bank is owned by 12 motherfuckers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:58.50,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们操纵我们的生活{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who run our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.59,0:21:00.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我打算买房子的时候…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they decide to put us into recession...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.67,0:21:03.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们搞出了个经济危机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just when I'm about to buy a house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:06.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像迈克·道格拉斯的那部电影{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,it's like that old Michael Douglas movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:08.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法院的12个法官…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know,the one with the 12 judges...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:12.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,违背司法公正?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that decide to hand out the wrong form ofjustice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:15.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么电影? - 大执法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was it again? - The Star Chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.31,0:21:17.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 就是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah,that's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:21.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界银行就是大执法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,I mean,the World Bank is the fucking Star Chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:25.07,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 喂 - 咋回事?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:27.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个SB在闪老子远光灯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some asshole blinking his high beam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:30.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去 混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go around,asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又慢下来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now he's slowing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:37.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你到底过不过去? - 冷静 不要减速{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Make up your mind,prick. - Just keep cool. Don't slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:45.97,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把车灯关了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hejust shut off his lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:49.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按紧急措施 不要停车 这可能是一次越狱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,we're in an emergency procedure. Don't stop. This could be an escape attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:54.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:57.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打开无线电{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the radio now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:59.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑泽尔顿…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Hazelton...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:03.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑泽尔顿 我是押送车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Hazelton,this is Custody Bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:12.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马勒戈壁的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:15.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草泥马{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.75,0:22:22.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑泽尔顿 我是格拉芙顿的2号押送车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Hazelton,this is Custody Bus 2 from Grafton Penitentiary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.21,0:22:25.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回话 完毕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in. Over. Come in. Over!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.07,0:23:34.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.08,0:23:41.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 警卫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,guard! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:45.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我们出来 我们要烧焦了 起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us out! We're gonna fry! Come on! Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.50,0:23:48.46,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我烧焦了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,don't let me burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.59,0:23:50.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想被烧焦 - 当然{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please,I don't wanna burn! - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.88,0:23:53.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人想成为烧饼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ofcourse the fucking torch doesn't wanna burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.51,0:23:55.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 瓦尔特 - 快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Walter! - Come on,man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.68,0:23:57.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快让我们出来 我们要烧焦了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please get us out of here! We're gonna burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.93,0:24:00.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人到车后面去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody move to the back ofthe bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.81,0:24:05.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查韦斯 走 从后面出来 快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chavez,move. We're getting out the back. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.69,0:24:09.19,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来 快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.14,0:24:45.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的快起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.65,0:24:49.57,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实点 不然我就杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,don't be a hero,and we'll be cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.65,0:24:52.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白? - 我把另外两人弄出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right? - Let me get the other two out ofthe bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.11,0:24:55.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 钥匙给我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fuck up and hand me the keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.11,0:24:58.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉在车里面了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the bus. I dropped them.{\r}
