Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.66,0:27:48.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我只找到这个 - 他撒谎 杀了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is the only set I found. - Fucking liar. Kill him.{\r}
