Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.47,0:28:06.51,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们本来应该多久到黑泽尔顿? - 天亮之前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- When was Hazelton expecting us? - Just before dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.60,0:28:10.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那我们还有5个小时的时间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Now,that gives us a five-hour head start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:14.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都戴着脚链 根本走不远{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man,we ain't going anywhere in a hurry all tethered together by the ankles like this.{\r}
