Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.78,0:28:29.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 威尔逊警卫要做我的指南针{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no,no. Officer Wilson here's gonna be my compass.{\r}
