Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:44.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们识相的话是不敢回来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't be coming back ifthey know what's good for them.{\r}
