Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.77,0:29:41.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是这个婊子干的? - 别傻了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A fucking little bitch did all this? - Don't be stupid.{\r}
