Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.92,0:30:03.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 闭嘴 混蛋 - 谁也不能走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just shut up,asshole. - Nobody's going anywhere.{\r}
