Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.73,0:30:20.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"它"? 我还以为是山里人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"It"? I thought it was just some hillbilly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.77,0:30:23.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它要吃人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It eats people.{\r}
