Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.57,0:30:33.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只手上只有三个指头 杀人吃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got,like,three fingers on one hand. And it kills to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.87,0:30:35.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.79,0:30:38.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 它为什么不吃森林里的动物?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So then,why doesn't it eat the animals in the woods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.29,0:30:43.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这里没有动物 我们就是它的食物{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there are none. It's a cannibal. We're its food.{\r}
