Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.85,0:30:59.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 两个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Two of'em.{\r}
