Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.96,0:39:42.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 可能吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Maybe I am.{\r}
