Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.54,0:41:50.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说昨天在河上游看到一辆卡车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said he spotted a truck up by the upper river inlet yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.42,0:41:53.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 看见那几个孩子了吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any sign ofthe kids? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.38,0:41:56.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你同意 我想去看看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's all the same to you,I thought I'd drive out there and take a look.{\r}
