Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.10,0:45:36.31,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许一两个小时 - 你最好找到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A couple of hours maybe. - You better find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.86,0:45:43.15,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要找块面包吃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh-ho-ho,man. I got to go pinch a loaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.28,0:45:46.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们分头走吧 - 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I say we split up. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.53,0:45:49.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许这是个好主意 - 你觉得需要投票吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe it's a good idea. - You think this is a democracy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.95,0:45:53.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想和我狡辩? - 你的人找到你之后又怎么样呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanna fuckin' debate me? - What happens when we meet up with your men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.16,0:45:55.25,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到时候你会干什么 查韦斯?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do then,Chavez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.33,0:45:57.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盗亦有道?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What ever happened to honor among thieves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.71,0:46:01.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会杀了我们所有的人 把钱独吞了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna kill us all,then you're gonna take the cash foryourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.30,0:46:04.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会这么做 - 你说的对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's what you're gonna do. - Yeah,you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.84,0:46:07.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可能会杀了你们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I probably will kill all ofyou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.13,0:46:09.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那我干脆现在就杀了你 - 祝你好运{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then why shouldn't we kill you now,eh? - Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.89,0:46:12.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好下手快点 否则你必死无疑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you better be quick,oryou're surely gonna be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.18,0:46:14.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就杀了你们所有人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll kill all you motherfuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:18.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得这不是你最好的选择{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't think that's in your best interest,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.77,0:46:22.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你最好妥协 - 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- compared to a compromise. - Hey. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.15,0:46:24.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚用一百元擦了屁股{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wiped my ass with a $100 bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.11,0:46:28.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你那一份里扣 给我闭嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's comin' out ofyour share,asshole. Now,shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.99,0:46:31.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你有什么好建议? - 你有一把枪 而我有两把{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you propose? - You got one gun. I got two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.87,0:46:33.79,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These humps have none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.87,0:46:37.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一人拿不了这么多的钱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,I can't carry all the bags ofcash on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.83,0:46:40.79,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你杀了我 你也少了一个帮你的人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ifyou kill me,that's one less pair of hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.88,0:46:43.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我还有你不具备的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus I have something none ofyou do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.13,0:46:45.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哦? 什么? - 设施{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? What's that? - Infrastructure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.46,0:46:46.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.84,0:46:49.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人会找到我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My men will find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.34,0:46:53.14,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以跟我到藏身处 不用再逃亡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all ofyou can come with us to a safe house and not be on the run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.22,0:46:56.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为交换 你们把一袋钱给我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in exchange for that,you give me one ofthe bags you're all carrying,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:58.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的一袋你自己留着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you all get to keep the other one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.89,0:47:01.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能相信他 弗洛伊德?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you trust him,Floyd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.52,0:47:03.73,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.28,0:47:07.90,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成交{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.74,0:47:16.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get this bum up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.79,0:47:22.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你朋友的事 很抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.13,0:47:24.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样下去不会有好结果{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't going to end well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.09,0:47:28.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道 - 那你怎么跟他们站在一边?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know that. - Then why are you going along with them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.92,0:47:30.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这之前 我们锁在一起的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up to now,being all chained together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.93,0:47:33.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有其他选择 不是吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really didn't have much ofa choice,did I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.93,0:47:39.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这两个小时内 我们已经是第四次经过这棵树了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's the fourth time we've passed that tree in the last two hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.60,0:47:42.69,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么打算 奈特?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you up to,Nate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.77,0:47:45.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待时机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bidin' my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.32,0:47:48.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查韦斯 发现了 他会杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chavez catches on,man,he'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.69,0:47:53.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是对的 奈特 我都注意到了 你要小心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right,Nate. Even I noticed. You gotta be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.99,0:47:59.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该回到路上 警察来的时候就自首{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go back to the road. Turn yourself in when the police arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.16,0:48:02.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能一个人穿过树林 没有武器{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not going back through the woods alone,unarmed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.25,0:48:05.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会被那个怪胎杀掉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get sliced up by that hillbilly freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.46,0:48:07.92,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和查韦斯… 一样危险{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who's worse... him or Chavez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.38,0:48:11.30,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.38,0:48:14.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们到达瞭望塔 我会尽量帮你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do what I can to help you once we've reached the ranger station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.97,0:48:17.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 但你应该首先自己小心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate that,but I thinkyou should look afteryourselffirst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.85,0:48:20.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着的人 查韦斯是不会带上一起走的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chavez isn't gonna bring anyone along for the ride that he can't use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.52,0:48:22.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're damn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:24.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会为了钱把我们都杀了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll kill us all for the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.02,0:48:27.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没被食人族先吃了的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifthat cannibal freak doesn't beat him to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.82,0:48:31.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是讽刺{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ironic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.11,0:48:35.99,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 钱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is? - Money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.07,0:48:38.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我努力一辈子上完学…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I struggled my whole life to put myselfthrough school...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.37,0:48:41.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 然后离开这里赚钱 - 如何?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- so I could get out of here and make good money. - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:46.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我手上拿的钱比许多人一辈子挣得都多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm holding in my hands more money than most people ever make in a lifetime,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.50,0:48:48.67,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我只想把它扔掉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all I wanna do is get rid of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.41,0:49:23.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是运木材的路 防火瞭望塔…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a logging access road. Fire watchtower's on the other side...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.29,0:49:24.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 在山的另一边 - 等下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- further along the mountain. - Hang on. Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:27.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 克劳福德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on. Hang on. Crawford.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.25,0:49:30.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.30,0:49:32.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能弄开那辆车吗? - 小菜一碟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thinkyou can jack that thing? - Piece ofcake,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.63,0:49:35.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于有辆车可以带我们离开了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally,a ride out ofthis shit-hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.43,0:49:38.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这是把我们撞到路边的那辆拖车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. That's the tow truck that ran us offthe road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.14,0:49:44.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才让克劳福德 帮我们搞到手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Crawford here is gonna go get it for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.64,0:49:49.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不? 克劳福德? - 我不知道 我说…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right,Crawford? - I don't know about that,man. I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.56,0:49:53.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是辆卡车 过去看看就是了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a truck.Just run over there and check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.32,0:49:56.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 我们有钱了 现在我们离开这鬼地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! We got the cash. Now let's get the hell out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.28,0:49:58.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 让当兵的去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way,man! Send soldier boy,damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.62,0:50:01.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是偷车贼 你才是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the car thief. You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.45,0:50:06.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是个陷阱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be a trap,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.46,0:50:09.50,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过去 混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get movin',asshole. Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.84,0:50:16.76,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.91,0:50:44.99,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.21,0:50:55.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的怪胎{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuckin' hillbilly motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.34,0:50:59.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要找到你 然后杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna find you,then I'm gonna fuckin' kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.76,0:51:01.97,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.47,0:51:07.48,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们原路返回 尽快离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's backtrack and get as far away from here as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.56,0:51:09.44,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要杀光我们才罢手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not gonna stop until we're all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.56,0:51:12.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这他妈的是谁? 告诉我 - 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who the fuck is he? Tell me right now! - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.31,0:51:14.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道 你是在这里长大的 警长说过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fuckyou don't! You grew up here! The sheriffsaid so!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.36,0:51:21.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好在这个怪物回来之前带我们离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you better get us the fuck out of here before that freak comes back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.99,0:51:23.62,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操他妈的 我们不需要他了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck him. We don't need him anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.70,0:51:26.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我 你们就要靠自己了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill me,and you're on your own... lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.29,0:51:30.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不管 - 他什么都不知道 你看不出来吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I don't give a shit. - He doesn't know anything! Can't you see  that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.29,0:51:33.54,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔 等等 如果现在杀了他 我们也完了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Just wait a minute. If you kill him now,we are fucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.63,0:51:35.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好么? 我们不知道怎么走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? We have no idea where we're going,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.05,0:51:39.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个怪物要把我们都干掉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with some crazy hick out there trying to pick us all offone by one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.72,0:51:46.68,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.77,0:51:49.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.19,0:51:52.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再惹我生气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,you don't want to see me angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.85,0:51:57.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带我去瞭望塔… 找到电话 听见了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,you get me to that station... and a phone,you hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:02.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.57,0:52:08.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下 天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.18,0:52:26.39,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要休息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.47,0:52:29.56,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我起来 接着走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck up. We gotta keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.39,0:52:34.19,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来 你们两个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up,both ofyou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.31,0:52:37.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 带着钱我们走的慢 我们最好扔掉 - 不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's the money that's slowing us down. We gotta lose it. - No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.61,0:52:39.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个小时之后就会找到我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be looking for us in a couple of hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.86,0:52:42.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们没到黑泽尔顿 FBI 联邦警察局…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifwe don't show up at Hazelton,the F.B.I.,U.S. Marshals...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.90,0:52:45.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有西佛吉尼亚的警察都会追捕你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and every law officer in West Virginia is gonna be hunting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.57,0:52:48.70,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布兰登说得对 要想逃 就搞快点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brandon's right. Ifyou want to get away,you need to move quicker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.79,0:52:51.29,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 把钱扔了 - 听我说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dump the money. - Now you listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.37,0:52:56.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么我们带着钱走 要么在这里等死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We move now with the cash,or we all wait here and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.17,0:52:58.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她拖了我们后退{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the one who's slowin' us down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.42,0:52:59.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.96,0:53:02.42,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.59,0:53:05.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.47,0:53:08.05,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过她长的很正点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a nice piece ofass though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.14,0:53:11.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把她给干了 再一枪杀了她…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let'sjust pass her around,then pop her in the head...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.98,0:53:14.39,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后走人…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get the fuck out of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.94,0:53:22.07,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你 你这个贱人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill you,you fuckin' bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.19,0:53:26.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notjust yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.28,0:53:29.20,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛋定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now be cool. Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.28,0:53:32.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this in hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.46,0:53:35.33,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be cool. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.83,0:53:39.50,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,you just chill the fuck out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.59,0:53:42.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你死定了 臭婊子 - 我们都死定了 婊子养的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're dead,bitch. - We're all dead,asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.96,0:53:46.26,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪还来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me my gun back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.34,0:53:49.72,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你很容易冲动啊 弗洛伊德{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you got some impulse-control issues there,Floyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.80,0:53:51.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会给你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.56,0:53:54.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果怪物出来 三把枪都在你手上可不是什么好事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You having all three guns does us no good ifthat freak comes after us again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.52,0:53:59.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意冒险{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then that'sjust a chance I'm gonna have to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:05.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很快就能找到我们 明早就会全面搜查{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna start lookin' for us soon. There'll be a full search by morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.61,0:54:07.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 如果我们能坚持到那个时候 - 我们会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ifwe make it till then. - We'll make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.03,0:54:10.66,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人好像不会轻易让你走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys don't look like they'rejust gonna let you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.29,0:54:16.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么还没杀你?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why haven't they killed you already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.50,0:54:19.25,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们需要我 - 如果不再需要了呢?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They need me. - And what happens when they don't need you anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.33,0:54:22.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不希望到这一步 瞭望塔里应该有无线电和手机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not planning on finding out. There should be a radio and cell phone at the watchtower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.67,0:54:24.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了之后我就呼救{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call for help once we get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.46,0:54:27.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个计划能行得通吗? - 那有个梯子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you plan on keeping this lot under control? - There's a ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.43,0:54:29.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次只能爬上去一个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one person can climb up at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.51,0:54:32.60,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,75英尺高 还要经过一个活动门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 75 feet straight up and through a trapdoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.68,0:54:35.43,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个瞭望塔都藏有把枪 我知道放在哪里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each station has a gun hidden in it,and I know where they keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.52,0:54:37.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里空间很小 我们上去之后就能伏击查韦斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a tight space. I can ambush Chavez when we're up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.48,0:54:41.06,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想回家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.28,0:54:47.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会好起来的 亚历克斯 我会带你脱身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be okay,Alex. I'll get you out ofthis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.11,0:55:25.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走路有点慢啊 弗洛伊德?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walkin' a little slow there,aren't you,Floyd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.19,0:55:27.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她把你伤得很重吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She hurt you that bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.65,0:55:31.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 去死吧 婊子 - 啊…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Die,bitch! - Wha...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.16,0:55:35.45,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.85,0:56:00.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡弗警长呼叫Lane 请回话 完毕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}SheriffCarver calling Deputy Lane. Come in. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:03.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾力 我是Calvin 回话 完毕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ally,this is Calvin. Come in. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.94,0:56:06.32,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,县警务局 我是卡弗警长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}County Dispatch,this is SheriffCarver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.44,0:56:09.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想报告一起情况 完毕 - 请讲 警长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want to report an emergency. Over. - Go,Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.44,0:56:11.95,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格拉芙顿监狱的押送车出了车祸…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The custody bus from Grafton Penitentiary has crashed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:14.74,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在老磨房路37号路标附近{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}offthe old mill road near mile marker 37.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.82,0:56:18.12,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我过去看看 完毕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm goin' in to take a look around. Carver out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.80,0:56:29.09,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 警务局 我是卡弗 - 请讲 警长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dispatch,this is Carver. - Come in,Sheriff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.17,0:56:32.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车上没人 我去找找看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no one onboard. Gonna see if I can track them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.63,0:56:35.34,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 完毕 - 收到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carver out. - Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.48,0:56:44.23,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 我们走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.80,0:57:14.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 停下 够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Stop. He's had enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.97,0:57:18.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够不够我说了算{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say when the Nazi bastard's had enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.14,0:57:25.10,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们去哪条路了? - 我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now,which way did they go? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.19,0:57:27.15,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没看见他们去哪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see 'em go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.23,0:57:28.81,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.90,0:57:32.03,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们怎么处置他?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,what do we do with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.11,0:57:34.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck him. Leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.49,0:57:39.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈特 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nate,I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.62,0:57:42.24,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跑不动了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't run anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.33,0:57:45.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我… 得休息一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I just need a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.08,0:57:47.08,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要接着走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.63,0:57:51.25,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要再过几个小时 我们就安全了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wejust have to make it a few more hours,and then we'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.34,0:57:53.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察就要来了 你能行的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police are coming. You can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.72,0:58:00.97,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 查韦斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen,Chavez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.06,0:58:03.27,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一个人无法离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't get out of here alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.39,0:58:06.73,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你也清楚? - 我有办法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know that,right? - I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.81,0:58:10.15,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我可以带你离开森林 - 你想要什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well,I can get you out ofthese woods. - So,what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.23,0:58:11.36,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公平的交易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fair deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.94,0:58:15.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要多少钱? - 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.57,0:58:17.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想要钱 我不需要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want the money. I don't need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.86,0:58:20.49,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要保证你的人来了之后 你要让我走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta promise me that you'll let me go when your boys show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:21.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.45,0:58:25.83,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另外 我也要一把枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And,uh,I also need one ofthose guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.91,0:58:27.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我要给你?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I give you a gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.83,0:58:31.84,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为追杀我们的人会一直追杀我们 直到死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because whatever's hunting us is gonna continue hunting us till we're both dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.92,0:58:34.88,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是简单的道理 两人有枪比一人有枪要好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's simple tactical strategy. Two gunners are better than one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.01,0:58:38.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要相信你?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why should I trust you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.55,0:58:40.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要整你?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I fuckyou?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.55,0:58:43.47,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你对付弗洛伊德了 是吧?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped you with Floyd,didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.56,0:58:46.27,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才也没跑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,I didn't run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.49,0:59:39.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.69,1:00:20.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要带他们去哪 奈特?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you take them,Nate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.53,1:00:25.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这把岁数已经跟不上了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm too old for this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.09,1:00:38.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.88,1:00:42.67,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了 我们走得还不够远{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go. We're not far now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.22,1:00:48.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 我们要快走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psst! We gotta move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.31,1:00:50.22,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.31,1:00:52.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我已经走不动了 - 加油{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't go on anymore. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.02,1:00:55.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.15,1:01:00.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们把袋子放这儿 来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Let's leave the bags down over here. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.61,1:01:05.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会回来拿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll come back for them later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.29,1:01:16.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该跑的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't have run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.08,1:01:17.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.09,1:01:21.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 婊子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut the fuck up,puta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.46,1:01:23.13,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是你的错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all your fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.22,1:01:25.80,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许我该先杀了你 - 等等 这样不会有什么用处的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I should end you first! - Wait. That's not gonna get us anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.89,1:01:27.55,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能让这婊子别再碍事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gets the bitch out ofthe way though!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.64,1:01:30.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞭望塔就在山的那边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The watchtower'sjust right over the hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.02,1:01:33.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一晚上就带着我们绕圈子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been leading us in circles all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.98,1:01:35.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要相信你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I believe you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.06,1:01:39.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在山那边… 我发誓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'sjust over the hill... right there. I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.02,1:01:44.11,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 只要两分钟就能看见了 - 让这个贱人走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It'll take two minutes to find out. Please. - Get this bitch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.33,1:01:52.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.48,1:02:20.61,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这个? 被烧焦的木炭?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it? A bunch offuckin' charcoal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.69,1:02:23.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 肯定被烧没了 - 不会吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It must've been burned down. - No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.61,1:02:25.53,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.61,1:02:28.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 我只知道这里有无线电{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. This is the only place I knew ofthat had a radio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.45,1:02:32.91,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都在耍我 是不是?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been fuckin' with me the whole time,haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.99,1:02:35.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 去死吧 你在撒谎{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Fuck you. You're a liar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.83,1:02:38.58,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没有撒谎 奈特以为这里会有瞭望塔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not lying. Nate thought the tower was gonna be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.67,1:02:41.75,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来打算在这里求救{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were gonna barricade ourselves in and call for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.84,1:02:46.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接着走吧 现在至少都3 4点了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,let'sjust keep moving,all right? It's gotta be at least 3:00 or 4:00 a.m. by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.09,1:02:48.93,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们可以去东北方向 - 我受够你的狗屁谎言了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We could go northeast. - I've had enough ofyour bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.01,1:02:51.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我跪下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on your fuckin' knees!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.72,1:02:54.89,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他妈的给我跪下 - 过了河10英里远有个小镇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get on your fuckin' knees! - There's a small town 10 miles past the  river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.97,1:02:58.27,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我带你去那儿 - 去你妈的 说再见吧 混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll take you there. - Fuckyou. Say good-bye,asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.35,1:03:00.40,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 想想吧 查韦斯 - 他就在这附近{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think about this,Chavez. - He's out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.48,1:03:01.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.57,1:03:05.73,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉的到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.82,1:03:08.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在跟踪我们 越来越近了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been following us. He's close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.86,1:03:11.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.29,1:03:20.21,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.55,1:03:28.17,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开 赶走这条疯狗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it off me! Get this fucking dog off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.26,1:03:30.59,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the gun! Down,boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.72,1:03:33.01,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 赶走这条狗 - 拿着他的枪 奈特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get the dog off me! - Take his guns,Nate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.02,1:03:41.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.06,1:03:45.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好 警长 见到你真是太高兴了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine,Sheriff. Just really glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.11,1:03:47.94,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没接我的电话 我… 就来看看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you didn't answer your cell,I... I came looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.07,1:03:50.82,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有其他人在那边 - 有多少人?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There are others out there. - How many?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.91,1:03:54.87,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 至少有一个囚犯和一个变态的山里人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know. At least one other prisoner and some freak hillbilly local.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.95,1:03:58.41,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山里人? 这不可能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hillbilly? That can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.50,1:04:02.04,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了 带我们离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Let'sjust get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.12,1:04:06.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我们快到上面去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Come on. Let's move it up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.71,1:04:10.38,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你 快点 起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,you,come on. Move your ass. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.47,1:04:12.18,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.26,1:04:15.14,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我快点 你这混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it,you son ofa bitch! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.51,1:04:18.52,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on,honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.10,1:04:23.02,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来了 越来越近了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's close. He's really close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.15,1:04:26.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁? - 他是个怪物{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is? - He's a fucking monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.94,1:04:29.86,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 我只想回家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Please. I just want to get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.94,1:04:33.57,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 别… 别怕 孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,all right.Just... Just calm down,little lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.25,1:04:45.83,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你觉得能不拿钱走出这个森林…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifyou thinkyou're moving out ofthis forest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.92,1:04:48.67,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就他妈的大错特错了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without going back for the cash,you're fuckin' wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.75,1:04:50.46,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now move. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.14,1:05:03.85,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中大奖了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jackpot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.94,1:05:07.15,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查韦斯 你这个蠢货{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chavez,you stupid son ofa bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.71,1:05:27.96,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是警长报告的车祸地点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where the sheriff reported the bus crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.04,1:05:31.50,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这种地形中步行 他们应该就在这个范围里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On foot in this terrain,they should be within this perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.59,1:05:34.63,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从所有周边开始 向里搜索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want it approached from all sides,and we'll work our way in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.72,1:05:36.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,空中支援什么时候能到?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When is the air support getting here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.72,1:05:39.35,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经起飞了 应该在一小时后之后到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the air. They should be here within the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.43,1:05:42.64,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们 那里有我们的一个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentleman,we have a man out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.73,1:05:45.77,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要千万小心{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want all precautions taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.90,1:05:47.98,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 出发 - 是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's move. - Yes,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.20,1:05:58.78,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我的包呢? - 你肯定放在这个地方了?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's my bags? - Are you sure this was the spot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.87,1:06:03.16,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个地方 老子的钱呢?{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,this was the spot. Now where's my goddamn fuckin' money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.29,1:06:05.37,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯? 弗洛伊德干的.{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh? It's Floyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.46,1:06:08.00,chs,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了那个混蛋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill that motherfucker.{\r}
